<title>FRANCE: France's Filipacchi 1996 sales rise slightly.</title>
<headline>France's Filipacchi 1996 sales rise slightly.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					 1,540.49 vs 1,509.33</p>
<p>    Of which fourth quarter			421.87 vs   407.14</p>
<p>NOTE - Filipacchi Medias, a subsidiary of Hachette, part of the Lagardere group, gave the figures in French Balo official bulletin BALO.</p>
